      "content": "To ensure the catering kitchen is aware of the severe nut allergies and vegan requirements, it's best to create a clear and concise communication document that outlines specific options and restrictions. You can share this document via email or during a meeting with the catering team to avoid any misunderstandings. Consider using visual aids like allergen logos or color-coding to label the buffet, making it easy for guests to identify safe options. This can be achieved using stickers or labeling wraps, keeping the design simple and easy to read.",
